H3 captures all possible errors during [request lifecycle](/guide/basics/lifecycle).

## `HTTPError`

You can create and throw HTTP errors using `HTTPError` with different syntaxes.

```js
import { HTTPError } from "h3";

app.get("/error", (event) => {
